### user-api calls

### User Register

POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "suresh",
    "lastName": "raina",
    "email": "suresh@gmail.com",
    "password": "raina123",
    "profileImageUrl": "http://exmaple.com/mahesh.jpg"
}

### login user
POST http://localhost:4000/common-api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"suresh@gmail.com",
    "password": "raina123"
}

### posting comment
PUT  http://localhost:4000/user-api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"69896b9a8621deecb54b4517",
    "articleId":"69897a19e5abadb069d5f0a7",
    "comments":"from this article"
}

//get allcomments
